~ start
if GameState.save_resource.talked_to_rat:
	Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is dialogue after we have spoken already.
	Nathan: Here are some choices.
	- First one
		Nathan: You picked the first one.
	- Second one
		Nathan: You picked the second one.
	- Start again => start
	- End the conversation => END
	Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
	=> END
else:
	do GameState._set_talked_to_rat()
	Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
	Nathan: Here are some choices.
	- First one
		Nathan: You picked the first one.
	- Second one
		Nathan: You picked the second one.
	- Start again => start
	- End the conversation => END
	Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
	=> END